(6762, 'うちの子、幼稚園のお泊まり会をすごく楽しみにしてたんだけど、風邪を引いちゃって、今抗生物質を飲ませたところなんです。だから、残念ながら今夜は欠席させて頂きます。', 'My kid was really looking forward to the kindergarten sleepover, but he got a cold and I just made him take antibiotics. So, sadly, he''ll be absent tonight.', 44, '{"Ja": "うちの子、幼稚園のお泊まり会をすごく楽しみにしてたんだけど、風邪を引いちゃって、今抗生物質を飲ませたところなんです。だから、残念ながら今夜は欠席させて頂きます。", "En": "My kid was really looking forward to the kindergarten sleepover, but he got a cold and I just made him take antibiotics. So, sadly, he''ll be absent tonight.", "Level": 44, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 6762, "Characters": "泊まり"}, {"SubjectId": 5389, "Characters": "内"}, {"SubjectId": 2513, "Characters": "子"}, {"SubjectId": 5186, "Characters": "幼稚"}, {"SubjectId": 5347, "Characters": "幼稚園"}, {"SubjectId": 6617, "Characters": "泊まる"}, {"SubjectId": 7523, "Characters": "会"}, {"SubjectId": 8902, "Characters": "凄い"}, {"SubjectId": 3484, "Characters": "楽しみ"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 7368, "Characters": "風邪"}, {"SubjectId": 2593, "Characters": "今"}, {"SubjectId": 3192, "Characters": "飲む"}, {"SubjectId": 3038, "Characters": "所"}, {"SubjectId": 3676, "Characters": "残念"}, {"SubjectId": 2890, "Characters": "今夜"}, {"SubjectId": 3979, "Characters": "欠席"}, {"SubjectId": 7857, "Characters": "頂く"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 462, "Characters": "子"}, {"SubjectId": 1352, "Characters": "幼"}, {"SubjectId": 1353, "Characters": "稚"}, {"SubjectId": 960, "Characters": "園"}, {"SubjectId": 1824, "Characters": "泊"}, {"SubjectId": 566, "Characters": "会"}, {"SubjectId": 704, "Characters": "楽"}, {"SubjectId": 853, "Characters": "風"}, {"SubjectId": 2086, "Characters": "邪"}, {"SubjectId": 507, "Characters": "引"}, {"SubjectId": 497, "Characters": "今"}, {"SubjectId": 1654, "Characters": "抗"}, {"SubjectId": 850, "Characters": "生"}, {"SubjectId": 718, "Characters": "物"}, {"SubjectId": 1242, "Characters": "質"}, {"SubjectId": 755, "Characters": "飲"}, {"SubjectId": 912, "Characters": "残"}, {"SubjectId": 906, "Char