(5712, 'いや、みんな「ハゲ散らかす」ってよく言うけど、ハゲは別に「散らかす」も「片付ける」もできないものだから！そんな言い方、失礼だろ。', 'I mean, everyone says "hage-chirakasu" (balding in a scattered, patchy way), but baldness isn''t something that "scatters" or that you can "tidy up." That kind of expression is just rude.', 33, '{"Ja": "いや、みんな「ハゲ散らかす」ってよく言うけど、ハゲは別に「散らかす」も「片付ける」もできないものだから！そんな言い方、失礼だろ。", "En": "I mean, everyone says \"hage-chirakasu\" (balding in a scattered, patchy way), but baldness isn''t something that \"scatters\" or that you can \"tidy up.\" That kind of expression is just rude.", "Level": 33, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5712, "Characters": "散らかす"}, {"SubjectId": 5624, "Characters": "否"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 7744, "Characters": "別"}, {"SubjectId": 3418, "Characters": "出来る"}, {"SubjectId": 3107, "Characters": "物"}, {"SubjectId": 2942, "Characters": "失礼"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 1466, "Characters": "散"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 785, "Characters": "別"}, {"SubjectId": 1718, "Characters": "片"}, {"SubjectId": 652, "Characters": "付"}, {"SubjectId": 510, "Characters": "方"}, {"SubjectId": 654, "Characters": "失"}, {"SubjectId": 541, "Characters": "礼"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": 5624, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "いや", "conjugation_type": "*", "conjugation_form": "*", "lemma_reading": "イヤ", "lemma": "否", "orth": "いや", "pron": "イヤ", "Pos1": {"Ja": "感動詞", "En": "感動詞"}, "Pos2": {"Ja": "一般", "En": "general"}}, {"SubjectId": null, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "、", "conjugation_type": "*", "conjugation_form": "*", "lemma_reading": "", "lemma": "、", "orth": "、", "pron": "", "Pos1": {"Ja": "補助記号", "En": "punctuation"}, "Pos2": {"Ja": "読点", "En": "comma"}}, {"SubjectId": null, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "みんな", "conjugation_type": "*", "conjugation_form": "*", "lemma_reading": "ミナ", "lemma": "皆", "orth": "みんな", "pron": "ミンナ", "Pos1": {"Ja": "名詞", "En": "noun"}, "Pos2": {"Ja": "普通名詞", "En": "common noun"}, "Pos3": {"Ja": "副詞可能"