(5879, '「こんにちは。サーモンいますか？妹なんですけど。」「わぁ、イクラじゃない！！！」「わぁ、紹介してよ！」「こちらが、フグ。（フグを指さしながら）」「初めまして。」「鰐蟹とキンニクマは知ってるわよね！」「やあ、イクラちゃん。久しぶり。」', 'Salmon-Roe: "Hi, is Salmon here? I’m her sister." Salmon: "Oh my God, Salmon-Roe!" Fugu: "Oh, introduce us!" Salmon: "This is Fugu." (Points at him.) Salmon-Roe: "Nice to meet you!" Salmon: "And you know Crabigator and Kinnikuma!" Crabigator & Kinnikuma: "Hi Salmon-Roe. Long time, no see."', 35, '{"Ja": "「こんにちは。サーモンいますか？妹なんですけど。」「わぁ、イクラじゃない！！！」「わぁ、紹介してよ！」「こちらが、フグ。（フグを指さしながら）」「初めまして。」「鰐蟹とキンニクマは知ってるわよね！」「やあ、イクラちゃん。久しぶり。」", "En": "Salmon-Roe: \"Hi, is Salmon here? I’m her sister.\" Salmon: \"Oh my God, Salmon-Roe!\" Fugu: \"Oh, introduce us!\" Salmon: \"This is Fugu.\" (Points at him.) Salmon-Roe: \"Nice to meet you!\" Salmon: \"And you know Crabigator and Kinnikuma!\" Crabigator & Kinnikuma: \"Hi Salmon-Roe. Long time, no see.\"", "Level": 35, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5879, "Characters": "紹介"}, {"SubjectId": 7564, "Characters": "今日は"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 2892, "Characters": "妹"}, {"SubjectId": 6043, "Characters": "紹介する"}, {"SubjectId": 4946, "Characters": "河豚"}, {"SubjectId": 7711, "Characters": "指差す"}, {"SubjectId": 7362, "Characters": "鰐"}, {"SubjectId": 7361, "Characters": "蟹"}, {"SubjectId": 2797, "Characters": "金"}, {"SubjectId": 5910, "Characters": "熊"}, {"SubjectId": 8697, "Characters": "知る"}, {"SubjectId": 2591, "Characters": "久しい"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 623, "Characters": "妹"}, {"SubjectId": 1586, "Characters": "紹"}, {"SubjectId": 1587, "Characters": "介"}, {"SubjectId": 797, "Characters": "指"}, {"SubjectId": 784, "Characters": "初"}, {"SubjectId": 2091, "Characters": "鰐"}, {"SubjectId": 2092, "Characters": "蟹"}, {"SubjectId": 631, "Characters": "知"}, {"SubjectId": 496, "Characters": "久"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": null, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "「", "conjugation_type": "*", "conjugation_form": "*", "lemma_reading": "", "lemma": "「", "orth": "「", "pron": "", "Pos1":