(6541, '父に夏至から11日目のことを何と呼ぶか知っているかと聞かれたので、得意気に「ハゲ症」って答えたんですけど、それって「ハゲ頭の症状」って意味になるみたいで。父は笑って、正しい答えは「半夏生」だよって教えてくれましたけどね。', 'My dad asked me if I knew what to call the eleventh day after the summer solstice, so I said triumphantly "hageshou," which literally means "baldness-symptom". He laughed and told me the correct answer was "hangeshou."', 41, '{"Ja": "父に夏至から11日目のことを何と呼ぶか知っているかと聞かれたので、得意気に「ハゲ症」って答えたんですけど、それって「ハゲ頭の症状」って意味になるみたいで。父は笑って、正しい答えは「半夏生」だよって教えてくれましたけどね。", "En": "My dad asked me if I knew what to call the eleventh day after the summer solstice, so I said triumphantly \"hageshou,\" which literally means \"baldness-symptom\". He laughed and told me the correct answer was \"hangeshou.\"", "Level": 41, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 6541, "Characters": "夏至"}, {"SubjectId": 2617, "Characters": "父"}, {"SubjectId": 2541, "Characters": "日"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 2781, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 4648, "Characters": "呼ぶ"}, {"SubjectId": 8697, "Characters": "知る"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 3208, "Characters": "聞く"}, {"SubjectId": 4200, "Characters": "得意"}, {"SubjectId": 2670, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 3052, "Characters": "答える"}, {"SubjectId": 9192, "Characters": "それ"}, {"SubjectId": 5054, "Characters": "症状"}, {"SubjectId": 3318, "Characters": "意味"}, {"SubjectId": 3252, "Characters": "成る"}, {"SubjectId": 3856, "Characters": "笑う"}, {"SubjectId": 2571, "Characters": "正しい"}, {"SubjectId": 3051, "Characters": "答え"}, {"SubjectId": 2971, "Characters": "教える"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 512, "Characters": "父"}, {"SubjectId": 659, "Characters": "夏"}, {"SubjectId": 1799, "Characters": "至"}, {"SubjectId": 476, "Characters": "日"}, {"SubjectId": 492, "Characters": "目"}, {"SubjectId": 582, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 1213, "Characters": "呼"}, {"SubjectId": 631, "Characters": "知"}, {"SubjectId": 763, "Characters": "聞"}, {"SubjectId": 1081, "Characters": "得"}, {"SubjectId": 811, "Characters"