(6864, '私が旅行者だと言うと、男は鐘の形をしたお守りの値段を明らかにつり上げたが、何だかそいつに悪い気がして、そのまま何も言わずに言われた通りの値段を払ったんだよ。', 'When I told him I was a tourist, he blatantly raised the price of the bell-shaped charm, but I felt a little sorry for him, so I held my tongue and paid the price he told me anyway.', 45, '{"Ja": "私が旅行者だと言うと、男は鐘の形をしたお守りの値段を明らかにつり上げたが、何だかそいつに悪い気がして、そのまま何も言わずに言われた通りの値段を払ったんだよ。", "En": "When I told him I was a tourist, he blatantly raised the price of the bell-shaped charm, but I felt a little sorry for him, so I held my tongue and paid the price he told me anyway.", "Level": 45, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 6864, "Characters": "鐘"}, {"SubjectId": 3714, "Characters": "私"}, {"SubjectId": 3327, "Characters": "旅行"}, {"SubjectId": 3890, "Characters": "旅行者"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 2692, "Characters": "男"}, {"SubjectId": 2822, "Characters": "形"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 5005, "Characters": "値段"}, {"SubjectId": 9274, "Characters": "明らか"}, {"SubjectId": 2781, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 3357, "Characters": "悪い"}, {"SubjectId": 2670, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 9205, "Characters": "その"}, {"SubjectId": 3470, "Characters": "通り"}, {"SubjectId": 5927, "Characters": "払う"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 923, "Characters": "私"}, {"SubjectId": 816, "Characters": "旅"}, {"SubjectId": 580, "Characters": "行"}, {"SubjectId": 690, "Characters": "者"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 555, "Characters": "男"}, {"SubjectId": 1910, "Characters": "鐘"}, {"SubjectId": 589, "Characters": "形"}, {"SubjectId": 968, "Characters": "守"}, {"SubjectId": 1176, "Characters": "値"}, {"SubjectId": 1315, "Characters": "段"}, {"SubjectId": 626, "Characters": "明"}, {"SubjectId": 450, "Characters": "上"}, {"SubjectId": 582, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 829, "Characters": "悪"}, {"SubjectId": 548, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 665, "Characters": "通"}, {"SubjectId": 1608, "Characters": "払"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId":